        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="EqCCOF2JMBVHCbhCQh1_-41" parent="1" style="shape=note;size=20;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;" value="&lt;p class=&quot;MsoListParagraph&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0in 0in 0in 0.5in; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; text-indent: -0.25in;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;Specialized module which is considered ‘outside’ (or first in) the Condition Index&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoListParagraph&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0in 0in 0in 0.5in; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; text-indent: -0.25in;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;calculation/step loop. While the underlying facility should (may?) continue to have its&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoListParagraph&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0in 0in 0in 0.5in; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; text-indent: -0.25in;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;degradation calculated, if any facilities on which this facility depends have degraded&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoListParagraph&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0in 0in 0in 0.5in; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; text-indent: -0.25in;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;then it should be assumed that this facility is no longer operation. Systems will use&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoListParagraph&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0in 0in 0in 0.5in; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; text-indent: -0.25in;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;work orders to a similar effect.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="80" width="500" x="340" y="150" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="EqCCOF2JMBVHCbhCQh1_-42" parent="1" style="shape=note;size=20;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;" value="&lt;p class=&quot;MsoListParagraph&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0in 0in 0in 0.5in; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; text-indent: -0.25in;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#ffffff&quot;&gt;The default amount of degradation for a system calculated on each time-step, amount&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoListParagraph&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0in 0in 0in 0.5in; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; text-indent: -0.25in;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#ffffff&quot;&gt;will depend on the time-period being used.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="80" width="500" x="340" y="250" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="EqCCOF2JMBVHCbhCQh1_-44" edge="1" parent="1" source="EqCCOF2JMBVHCbhCQh1_-12" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;entryPerimeter=0;" target="EqCCOF2JMBVHCbhCQh1_-41">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry">
            <Array as="points" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="EqCCOF2JMBVHCbhCQh1_-45" parent="1" style="shape=note;size=20;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;" value="&lt;p class=&quot;MsoListParagraph&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0in 0in 0in 0.5in; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; text-indent: -0.25in;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#ffffff&quot;&gt;Generalize way to assess how this entity is used over the course of a day e.g. 24/7,&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoListParagraph&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0in 0in 0in 0.5in; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; text-indent: -0.25in;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#ffffff&quot;&gt;occasional, work hours, rare. Or any applicable cases not mentioned.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="80" width="500" x="340" y="350" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="EqCCOF2JMBVHCbhCQh1_-47" parent="1" style="shape=note;size=20;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;" value="&lt;p class=&quot;MsoListParagraph&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0in 0in 0in 0.5in; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; text-indent: -0.25in;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#ffffff&quot;&gt;Chance based large scale/external event that would impact infrastructure&#39;s ability to&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoListParagraph&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0in 0in 0in 0.5in; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; text-indent: -0.25in;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#ffffff&quot;&gt;function e.g. adversarial attacks, weather disasters, power failure. Or any applicable&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoListParagraph&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0in 0in 0in 0.5in; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; text-indent: -0.25in;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#ffffff&quot;&gt;cases not mentioned. Events would be likely to require a cold restart of the entity, a&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoListParagraph&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0in 0in 0in 0.5in; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; text-indent: -0.25in;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#ffffff&quot;&gt;known source of failure in infrastructure, so this module should calculate potential impact&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoListParagraph&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0in 0in 0in 0.5in; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; text-indent: -0.25in;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#ffffff&quot;&gt;on condition for this paradigm.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="80" width="500" x="340" y="450" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="EqCCOF2JMBVHCbhCQh1_-49" parent="1" style="shape=note;size=20;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;" value="&lt;p class=&quot;MsoListParagraph&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0in 0in 0in 0.5in; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; text-indent: -0.25in;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#ffffff&quot;&gt;Should use the presence of any &#39;Work Order&#39; and its individual attributes to calculate&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoListParagraph&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0in 0in 0in 0.5in; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; text-indent: -0.25in;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#ffffff&quot;&gt;ongoing impact on condition. Should handle outstanding (complete/incomplete), mission&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoListParagraph&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0in 0in 0in 0.5in; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; text-indent: -0.25in;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#ffffff&quot;&gt;criticality (impacts mission function), severity, and time.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="80" width="500" x="340" y="550" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="EqCCOF2JMBVHCbhCQh1_-51" parent="1" style="shape=note;size=20;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;" value="&lt;p class=&quot;MsoListParagraph&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0in 0in 0in 0.5in; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; text-indent: -0.25in;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#ffffff&quot;&gt;Location specific calculations which reflect unique elements of the environment which&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoListParagraph&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0in 0in 0in 0.5in; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; text-indent: -0.25in;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#ffffff&quot;&gt;might impact a facility of system (e.g. nearness to an ocean would have a higher severity&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoListParagraph&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0in 0in 0in 0.5in; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; text-indent: -0.25in;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#ffffff&quot;&gt;of corrosion due to salt in the air)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="80" width="500" x="340" y="720" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="EqCCOF2JMBVHCbhCQh1_-52" edge="1" parent="1" source="EqCCOF2JMBVHCbhCQh1_-25" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;entryPerimeter=0;" target="EqCCOF2JMBVHCbhCQh1_-51">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry">
            <Array as="points">
              <mxPoint x="320" y="810" />
              <mxPoint x="320" y="760" />
            </Array>
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="EqCCOF2JMBVHCbhCQh1_-53" parent="1" style="shape=note;size=20;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;" value="&lt;p class=&quot;MsoListParagraph&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0in 0in 0in 0.5in; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; text-indent: -0.25in;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#ffffff&quot;&gt;Uses historical weather data at the location to assess how weather could affect an entity&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoListParagraph&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0in 0in 0in 0.5in; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; text-indent: -0.25in;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#ffffff&quot;&gt;through the course of its lifecycle (heating and cooling, humidity, temperature, etc.)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="80" width="500" x="340" y="830" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="EqCCOF2JMBVHCbhCQh1_-55" parent="1" style="shape=note;size=20;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;" value="&lt;p class=&quot;MsoListParagraph&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0in 0in 0in 0.5in; text-indent: -0.25in;&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;Based on the UFC Grading of a given facility, this should remain at the end of the&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoListParagraph&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0in 0in 0in 0.5in; text-indent: -0.25in;&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;calculation flow as it would consider the current condition index against its own gradation&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoListParagraph&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0in 0in 0in 0.5in; text-indent: -0.25in;&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Calibri, sans-serif&quot;&gt;to assess if the facility would be able to maintain operation through some level of failure.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="80" width="500" x="340" y="930" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
